OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 03 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1988FRTE 2 is relaunched as Network
OL,7,F2.
OL,8,
OL,9,CG1994FSky Soap begins broadcasting.
OL,10,FThe channel aired UK and American
OL,11,Fsoaps, between 8am and 12pm. It's
OL,12,Ftransmission slot later changed to 12pm
OL,13,F- 4pm, and from 1997, 11am - 4pm The
OL,14,Fchannel closed on 30th April 1999.
OL,15,
OL,16,CG1994FSky Travel begins broadcasting -
OL,17,Fspecialising in travel-related
OL,18,Fprogramming and advertising. It
OL,19,Frelaunched as Sky Real Lives on 7th
OL,20,FNovember 2007. The channel ceased
OL,21,Fbroadcasting on 19th August 2010.
